    "name": "The Auto Sort Is Broken",
    "steam_appid": 3201030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Auto Sort is Broken, and it's now up to you to take on the task of organizing players' inventories.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The objective is simple: group identical items to organize the inventories and earn your reward!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/47b0034d6565957b54cd0e66ba2daed9.poster.avif?t=1737643457\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/47b0034d6565957b54cd0e66ba2daed9.webm?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/47b0034d6565957b54cd0e66ba2daed9.mp4?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now that players are coming to your shop, you'll hear plenty of stories about the struggles of typical RPG/MMORPG players, such as pay-to-win mechanics, unbalanced classes, and much more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/e08602e3a6670b13f6530f8782778fe7.poster.avif?t=1737643457\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/e08602e3a6670b13f6530f8782778fe7.webm?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/e08602e3a6670b13f6530f8782778fe7.mp4?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organizing inventories may seem like an easy task, but as players progress through the world, increasingly chaotic bags find their way into your shop\u2014along with impatient adventurers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/1ebc4ac54f4213b0ba6007dd60e71821.poster.avif?t=1737643457\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/1ebc4ac54f4213b0ba6007dd60e71821.webm?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/1ebc4ac54f4213b0ba6007dd60e71821.mp4?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/e630ff1b8b3a970f1355aa107916f20d.poster.avif?t=1737643457\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/e630ff1b8b3a970f1355aa107916f20d.webm?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/e630ff1b8b3a970f1355aa107916f20d.mp4?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The coins you earn from organizing inventories can be spent on secret achievements that unveil the story of the RPG/MMORPG world\u2014a place where the developers seem to care only about profit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/d168368af6f7a40edf4fd2e34d7f43ab.poster.avif?t=1737643457\" width=616 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/d168368af6f7a40edf4fd2e34d7f43ab.webm?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/d168368af6f7a40edf4fd2e34d7f43ab.mp4?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 80 handcrafted inventories waiting to be organized.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing music and custom sound effects designed exclusively for the game.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sharpen your spatial skills to find the optimal organization for each inventory.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy the humor as players vent about the typical issues of MMORPG games.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow the story of an MMORPG dying due to the greed of its developers.</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Auto Sort is Broken, and it's now up to you to take on the task of organizing players' inventories.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The objective is simple: group identical items to organize the inventories and earn your reward!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/47b0034d6565957b54cd0e66ba2daed9.poster.avif?t=1737643457\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/47b0034d6565957b54cd0e66ba2daed9.webm?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/47b0034d6565957b54cd0e66ba2daed9.mp4?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now that players are coming to your shop, you'll hear plenty of stories about the struggles of typical RPG/MMORPG players, such as pay-to-win mechanics, unbalanced classes, and much more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/e08602e3a6670b13f6530f8782778fe7.poster.avif?t=1737643457\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/e08602e3a6670b13f6530f8782778fe7.webm?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/e08602e3a6670b13f6530f8782778fe7.mp4?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organizing inventories may seem like an easy task, but as players progress through the world, increasingly chaotic bags find their way into your shop\u2014along with impatient adventurers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/1ebc4ac54f4213b0ba6007dd60e71821.poster.avif?t=1737643457\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/1ebc4ac54f4213b0ba6007dd60e71821.webm?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/1ebc4ac54f4213b0ba6007dd60e71821.mp4?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/e630ff1b8b3a970f1355aa107916f20d.poster.avif?t=1737643457\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/e630ff1b8b3a970f1355aa107916f20d.webm?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/e630ff1b8b3a970f1355aa107916f20d.mp4?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The coins you earn from organizing inventories can be spent on secret achievements that unveil the story of the RPG/MMORPG world\u2014a place where the developers seem to care only about profit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/d168368af6f7a40edf4fd2e34d7f43ab.poster.avif?t=1737643457\" width=616 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/d168368af6f7a40edf4fd2e34d7f43ab.webm?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201030/extras/d168368af6f7a40edf4fd2e34d7f43ab.mp4?t=1737643457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 80 handcrafted inventories waiting to be organized.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing music and custom sound effects designed exclusively for the game.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sharpen your spatial skills to find the optimal organization for each inventory.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy the humor as players vent about the typical issues of MMORPG games.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow the story of an MMORPG dying due to the greed of its developers.</strong></p></li></ul>",
